Description: @{package} — generate code in many languages from proved Lean programs
 Builds a Lake project with Lean, which checks its proofs, and generates the program as a
 Rust crate or as a package in C, Go, Python, Swift or TypeScript, running on the lungo
 runtime. Installs under @{prefix} with a @{link} launcher.
